OL,3,GNEWSACommunity ownership could restore
OL,4,Acity landmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity residents are to be offered the
OL,7,Fchance to play their part in raising
OL,8,Fmore than #500,000 needed to bring a
OL,9,Fmuch-loved historic landmark into
OL,10,Fcommunity ownership.
OL,12,FBristol's Ashton Court Mansion Trust
OL,13,Fhas launched a campaign where people
OL,14,Fcan invest in shares costing #100 each
OL,15,Fin the derelict mansion.
OL,17,FIn November, the city council will
OL,18,Fdecide whether the trust can have a
OL,19,F125-year lease of the building, and
OL,20,Fbefore that the trust needs to prove it
OL,21,Fcan operate sustainably.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
