OL,3,GNEWSACommunity ownership could restore
OL,4,Acity landmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust's vice chair, Josh Nesfield,
OL,7,Fsaid: "The #500,000 is what unlocks
OL,8,Fwhat comes next, giving us the working
OL,9,Fcapital we need to secure the lease
OL,10,F[and] begin opening more of the
OL,11,Fmansion."
